[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0071","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0071.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-31996","title":"OpenClaw safeBins 输入验证绕过漏洞","description":"OpenClaw 工具集 tools.exec.safeBins 组件存在输入验证绕过漏洞，攻击者可通过 sort 命令的 -o 输出标志参数实现任意文件写入，或通过 grep 命令的 -R 递归标志参数实现任意文件读取，绕过原本仅允许标准输入的限制。该漏洞影响 2026.2.19 之前的所有 OpenClaw 版本，CVSS 评分 2.0，危害等级低。攻击者需具备命令执行权限方可利用。","severity":"LOW","score":2.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-31996"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-03-19T02:16:04.917","updated":"2026-06-17T10:34:54.223","remediation":"升级 OpenClaw 至 2026.2.19 或更新版本，该版本已修复 safeBins 的 stdin-only 检查绕过问题。如无法立即升级，可限制 tools.exec.safeBins 中允许的命令列表，禁止使用含有 -o（sort）或 -R（grep）等危险 flag 的命令，或在调用层对命令参数进行白名单校验。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/commit/2c05cbb43e48ebad03626d3125746fb1b9a8520f","https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/security/advisories/GHSA-4685-c5cp-vp95","https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/openclaw-safebins-stdin-only-bypass-via-sort-output-and-recursive-grep-flags","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e37edb84f090321c2ab4b4aefc57f84a75b1b940/cves/2026/31xxx/CVE-2026-31996.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ccf2cc3d762789b06638ba5aa3e06982a53080c8/npm/openclaw/CVE-2026-31996.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/39b22452fe579e54bd7f5c66d1416f8c94c190d0/content/posts/cve-2026-31996.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a72c2d0c49169a0d402485a1b08b9cdd8f9a4630/2026/31xxx/CVE-2026-31996.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-31996.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/CYBERDUDEBIVASH-THREAT-INTEL-PLATFORM/blob/c2a7366c6314deb6352bda7e9037ec2fa014f8f8/threat/cve-2026-31996---openclaw-2026219---safebins-stdin-only-bypass-via-sort-output-a.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/02/GHSA-4685-c5cp-vp95/GHSA-4685-c5cp-vp95.json","https://github.com/jgamblin/OpenClawCVEs/blob/3bb47bb7401b637bc1868398eea55a397c005c64/ADVISORIES.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f73aeebc806b7ab5e9488498a056b9fa7bf30dd7/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-31996.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/9c5d67a198e99294f34c44ceb3609166657a0a6c/CVEs_log/2026-03-20_zh.md","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-31996"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0071.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0006","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0006.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-0006","title":"Google Android 多个组件堆缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Google Android 系统多个位置存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-122），攻击者可通过特制网络数据包触发越界读写。该漏洞无需用户交互即可远程利用，且不需要任何执行权限，成功利用后可导致任意代码执行，完全控制目标设备。影响包括 Android 16 在内的多个版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-0006","CNNVD-2026-10345968"],"sources":["cve","cnnvd"],"published":"2026-03-02","updated":"2026-06-17","remediation":"升级至 Android 安全补丁级别 2026-03-05 或更高版本。进入设置 > 系统 > 系统更新，检查并安装更新。企业用户应通过 MDM 策略强制推送安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-12T23:00:00Z","references":["https://source.android.com/docs/security/bulletin/2026/2026-03-01"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0006.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0257","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0257.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-28231","title":"bigcat88 pillow-heif 编码路径缓冲区验证整数溢出漏洞","description":"pillow-heif 库的编码路径缓冲区验证中存在整数溢出漏洞。当攻击者提供特制的大尺寸 HEIF 图像时，`_pillow_heif.c` 中的 `_CtxWriteImage_add_plane()` 函数在缓冲区边界检查时发生整数溢出，导致堆越界读取。该漏洞可在默认配置下触发，无需特殊权限，可能导致服务器堆内存泄露至编码图像中（信息泄露）或进程崩溃（拒绝服务）。该漏洞影响 pillow-heif 1.3.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。建议升级至 1.3.0 或更高版本修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-28231","GHSA-5gjj-6r7v-ph3x"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-02-27T20:21:40.697","updated":"2026-06-17T10:28:22.607","remediation":"升级 pillow-heif 至 1.3.0 或更高版本，该版本修复了编码路径缓冲区验证中的整数溢出问题。如无法立即升级，应避免处理来自不可信来源的超大 HEIF 图片文件，并限制图片尺寸输入范围作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/bigcat88/pillow_heif/commit/8305a15d3780c533b762578cbe987d27a2c59c7a","https://github.com/bigcat88/pillow_heif/releases/tag/v1.3.0","https://github.com/bigcat88/pillow_heif/security/advisories/GHSA-5gjj-6r7v-ph3x","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2026/CVE-2026-28231.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/21e8713bd16ad152d6b946e7bfcd11df673c4829/cves/2026/28xxx/CVE-2026-28231.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/pi-heif/CVE-2026-28231.yml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-03-01_2026-03-19/TIER_2_CVE-2026-28231.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2167857fddab84dfe24129edd6c6319301254e21/2026/28xxx/CVE-2026-28231.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-28231.md","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2026.txt","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/aad1d5d7fcfd4bf7bee792090d157de726946a96/vulns/pi-heif/PYSEC-2026-2248.yaml","https://github.com/bmwiedemann/openSUSE/blob/7cc613328d649b293f694d9c455d79676ac23def/packages/p/python-pillow-heif/.rev","https://github.com/bigcat88/pillow_heif/blob/7127731b75cdc7872ff0e26255fab8cb32204e75/CHANGELOG.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0257.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0068","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0068.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-26324","title":"OpenClaw SSRF 防护绕过漏洞","description":"OpenClaw 个人 AI 助手存在服务端请求伪造（SSRF）防护绕过漏洞。攻击者可通过构造完整格式的 IPv4 映射 IPv6 地址（如 `0:0:0:0:0:ffff:7f00:1`，即 `127.0.0.1`）绕过 SSRF 防护机制，向本应被拦截的环回地址、私有网络或链路本地元数据端点发起请求，可能导致敏感信息泄露或内网探测。该漏洞影响 2026.2.14 之前的版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。开发者已在 2026.2.14 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-26324"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-02-19T23:16:25.653","updated":"2026-06-17T10:26:05.667","remediation":"升级到 OpenClaw 2026.2.14 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在网络层或应用层防火墙添加规则，拦截包含 0:0:0:0:0:ffff: 前缀的 IPv4-mapped IPv6 请求目标，并限制出站请求仅允许白名单目标地址。同时审查 SSRF 防护逻辑，确保 IPv6 字面量也被正确解析和过滤。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/commit/c0c0e0f9aecb913e738742f73e091f2f72d39a19","https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/releases/tag/v2026.2.14","https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/security/advisories/GHSA-jrvc-8ff5-2f9f","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-26324"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0068.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0068.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0253","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0253.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-26193","title":"Open WebUI iFrame嵌入响应消息存储型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Open WebUI 是一款自托管的离线人工智能平台，其响应消息中的 iFrame 嵌入功能存在存储型跨站脚本（Stored XSS）漏洞。攻击者通过手动修改聊天历史记录，在响应消息中设置恶意的 `embeds` 属性，该属性内容被加载到 iFrame 中时，沙箱策略配置了 `allow-scripts` 和 `allow-same-origin` 权限，绕过了系统的 \"iframe Sandbox Allow Same Origin\" 安全配置。攻击者可将包含恶意载荷的聊天链接分享给同一实例上的其他用户，触发 XSS 攻击，导致用户会话劫持或敏感信息窃取。该漏洞影响 0.6.44 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.3，危害等级高，建议用户升级至 0.6.44 或更高版本修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-26193","GHSA-vjm7-m4xh-7wrc"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-02-19T20:25:42.453","updated":"2026-06-17T10:25:55.207","remediation":"升级 Open WebUI 至 0.6.44 或以上版本，该版本修复了 iFrame embed 未正确遵循沙箱配置的问题。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层配置 Content-Security-Policy 头，限制 frame-src 和 script-src 来源，并禁用 iframe 的 allow-same-origin 和 allow-scripts 权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/blob/6f1486ffd0cb288d0e21f41845361924e0d742b3/src/lib/components/chat/Messages/ResponseMessage.svelte#L689-L703","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/security/advisories/GHSA-vjm7-m4xh-7wrc","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2026/26xxx/CVE-2026-26193.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-26193.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/open-webui/CVE-2026-26193.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/26xxx/CVE-2026-26193.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/96dab026b1d19f98191e031637542a72caf337dc/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-26193/README.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/6bd321daede8b80ea61873e82166bcee99250c6a/cve/CVE-2026-26193.html","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/62f018f20b9d742e5172b0bfe0117dd1e316969c/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-26193-open-webui-vulnerable-to-stored-xss-via-iframe-embeds-in-response-messages.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-vjm7-m4xh-7wrc/GHSA-vjm7-m4xh-7wrc.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-26193.json","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/960c38c8fcadb4782e86773e98d193e1c5a308f1/vulndb/vulns/github/2026/07/VW-2026-29524.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0253.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0253.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0049","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0049.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-26192","title":"Open WebUI 存储型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Open WebUI 是一款自托管的离线 AI 平台，其引文预览功能存在存储型跨站脚本（Stored XSS）漏洞。攻击者通过手动篡改聊天历史记录，在文档元数据中设置恶意的 `html` 属性，使前端将文档内容作为 HTML 渲染并在 iFrame 中预览引文，从而注入并执行任意 JavaScript 代码。该 payload 在共享聊天中查看引文时同样生效。漏洞影响 0.7.0 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.3，危害等级高。攻击者需具备修改聊天历史的能力，利用难度较低，可导致会话劫持、数据窃取等后果。官方已在 0.7.0 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-26192","GHSA-xc8p-9rr6-97r2"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-02-19T20:25:42.290","updated":"2026-06-17T10:25:55.093","remediation":"立即将 Open WebUI 升级至 v0.7.0 或更高版本，该版本修复了通过 iFrame 渲染文档 HTML 内容导致的存储型 XSS 问题。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层过滤或转义用户上传文档中 metadata 的 html 属性值，避免前端直接渲染为 HTML。同时建议限制非受信用户修改聊天历史记录的权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/blob/6f1486ffd0cb288d0e21f41845361924e0d742b3/src/lib/components/chat/Messages/Citations/CitationModal.svelte#L163-L170","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/security/advisories/GHSA-xc8p-9rr6-97r2","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2026/CVE-2026-26192.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2026/26xxx/CVE-2026-26192.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/open-webui/CVE-2026-26192.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/26xxx/CVE-2026-26192.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/96dab026b1d19f98191e031637542a72caf337dc/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-26192/README.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/6bd321daede8b80ea61873e82166bcee99250c6a/cve/CVE-2026-26192.html","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-26192.md","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2026.txt","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/62f018f20b9d742e5172b0bfe0117dd1e316969c/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-26192-open-webui-vulnerable-to-stored-xss-via-iframe-in-citations-model.md","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/aad1d5d7fcfd4bf7bee792090d157de726946a96/vulns/open-webui/PYSEC-2026-2769.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0049.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0049.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0252","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0252.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-25527","title":"changedetection.io 未授权静态路径遍历漏洞","description":"changedetection.io 是一款开源网页变更检测工具，其 `/static/<group>/<filename>` 路由存在路径遍历漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证即可将 `group` 参数设置为 `..`，导致 `send_from_directory` 函数将基目录上移至 `/app/changedetectionio`，从而读取应用源码文件（如 `flask_app.py`）。该漏洞影响 0.53.2 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 5.3，危害等级中危，可能导致敏感信息泄露。厂商已在 0.53.2 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-25527","GHSA-9jj8-v89v-xjvw"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-02-19T15:16:11.947","updated":"2026-06-17T10:24:47.783","remediation":"升级至 changedetection.io 0.53.2 及以上版本，该版本修复了 `/static/<group>/<filename>` 路由的路径遍历漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层面（如 Nginx）添加规则，过滤含 `..` 的静态路径请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/dgtlmoon/changedetection.io/commit/9d38b4517364831889b5b0d7b3465fd060403fd4","https://github.com/dgtlmoon/changedetection.io/security/advisories/GHSA-9jj8-v89v-xjvw","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2026/CVE-2026-25527.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2026/CVE-2026-25527.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/efa56541ba84ae91eb0da267c473426b115491e2/http/cves/2026/CVE-2026-25527.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2026/25xxx/CVE-2026-25527.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/25xxx/CVE-2026-25527.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-25527.md","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2026-25527.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-9jj8-v89v-xjvw/GHSA-9jj8-v89v-xjvw.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-25527.json","https://github.com/runZeroInc/nuclei-templates/blob/9238de8f3cf6aee095a9c59813ce1d5bb6ba2585/http/cves/2026/CVE-2026-25527.yaml","https://github.com/rxerium/CISA-KEV/blob/c2a438961cf6a6c47831738d9c79cfc3110107fc/data/lists/NucleiList.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0252.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0067","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0067.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-25848","title":"JetBrains Hub 认证绕过与远程代码执行漏洞","description":"JetBrains Hub 存在认证绕过漏洞（CWE-306），未经身份认证的远程攻击者可绕过登录验证机制直接访问管理后台接口，进而执行管理员权限操作，可能导致数据泄露或远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 JetBrains Hub 2025.3.119807 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 9.1，危害等级严重。官方已发布修复版本 2025.3.119807，建议用户立即升级。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-25848"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-02-09T11:16:15.150","updated":"2026-06-17T10:25:19.267","remediation":"立即升级 JetBrains Hub 至 2025.3.119807 或更高版本，该版本已修复认证绕过漏洞。若无法立即升级，可在反向代理层对 Hub 管理端添加 IP 白名单访问控制并启用多因素认证（MFA）作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.jetbrains.com/privacy-security/issues-fixed/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e37edb84f090321c2ab4b4aefc57f84a75b1b940/cves/2026/25xxx/CVE-2026-25848.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a72c2d0c49169a0d402485a1b08b9cdd8f9a4630/2026/25xxx/CVE-2026-25848.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-25848.md","https://github.com/3kz2501/3kz_blog/blob/3c127e5eb4b8cc07df69dd35deb87186e3c62f2e/app/routes/posts/2026-02-09_CVE-2026-25848.mdx","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/unreviewed/2026/02/GHSA-m7gw-jxv4-qv8m/GHSA-m7gw-jxv4-qv8m.json","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/e1686fb6d9ff590e56242cf0983cd0f4c2346da7/docs/2026/JetBrains_Hub_%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%81%E7%BB%95%E8%BF%87%E4%B8%8E_RCE_%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-25848.toml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f73aeebc806b7ab5e9488498a056b9fa7bf30dd7/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-25848.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/9c5d67a198e99294f34c44ceb3609166657a0a6c/CVEs_log/2026-02-10_en.md","https://github.com/wooluo/vuln_crawler/blob/e03d16ab391fba060ae363e219446397a911d703/vulnerability_reports/vulnerability_report_2026-02-10_10-05-11.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2026-25848.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-25848"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0067.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0067.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0067.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0065","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0065.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-25253","title":"OpenClaw gatewayUrl 认证令牌窃取远程代码执行漏洞","description":"OpenClaw（又称 clawdbot/Moltbot）在 2026.1.29 之前版本中存在认证令牌窃取漏洞。该软件从查询字符串中获取 gatewayUrl 参数后，自动发起 WebSocket 连接并发送认证令牌，未经过用户确认或弹窗提示。远程攻击者可构造恶意链接诱使已认证用户访问，从而窃取其认证令牌，进而获取 OpenClaw Control UI 的控制权限，可能导致远程代码执行。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高，影响所有低于 2026.1.29 的版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-25253"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-02-01T23:15:49.717","updated":"2026-06-17T10:24:22.340","remediation":"升级 OpenClaw 至 2026.1.29 或更高版本（包含 GHSA-g8p2-7wf7-98mq 修复）。在反向代理层配置规则拦截含 `gatewayUrl` 的查询参数，部署 WAF 规则阻断恶意请求。限制 OpenClaw 仅监听 127.0.0.1，通过 SSH 隧道或 VPN 远程访问。禁用 WebSocket 自动令牌发送，为 Control UI 操作添加用户确认弹窗。定期轮换认证令牌。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://depthfirst.com/post/1-click-rce-to-steal-your-moltbot-data-and-keys","https://ethiack.com/news/blog/one-click-rce-moltbot","https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/security/advisories/GHSA-g8p2-7wf7-98mq","https://openclaw.ai/blog","https://x.com/0xacb/status/2016913750557651228","https://github.com/ethiack/moltbot-1click-rce","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/2026/CVE-2026-25253.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/f7944fe38a3988ee533761e6cdb5e68d67eefff2/openclaw/CVE-2026-25253/README.md","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/edea45bcf3f5f232d6349d094e3ed87f8aba3ba7/doc/2026-03/OpenClaw%20%20CVE-2026-25253%20RCE%20%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20POC.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/112473d365191630e7fadc1a06761a3cd69c00f7/data/2026/CVE-2026-25253-EQSTLab_CVE-2026-25253.md","https://github.com/FlorianBruniaux/claude-code-ultimate-guide/blob/fa57065576d3cc77be9231d34c450a26347dabd6/whitepapers/fr/03-securite.qmd","https://github.com/Threekiii/Vulnerability-Wiki/blob/b32b83c01eabac4d6b4b334852be9cff76ba67ee/docs-base/docs/ai/_sidebar.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/f7944fe38a3988ee533761e6cdb5e68d67eefff2/openclaw/CVE-2026-25253/README.zh-cn.md","https://github.com/moltis-org/moltis/blob/a55c44256e39536b12f8b6c077d1c4ba0c06d37f/crates/httpd/src/ws.rs","https://github.com/agentscope-ai/AgentTeams/blob/e6fa64c0cb7b14600c6abbf9b4a25f47bf544c1f/blog/hiclaw-announcement.md","https://github.com/SponsioLabs/Sponsio/blob/c9bc7f6c430f96ee8b824a1203cb086035593c20/llms-full.txt","https://github.com/adibirzu/openclaw-security-monitor","https://github.com/al4n4n/CVE-2026-25253-research","https://github.com/EQSTLab/CVE-2026-25253","https://github.com/FrigateCaptain/openclaw_vulnerabilities_and_solutions","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-25253"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0065.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0170","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0170.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-21858","title":"n8n Ni8mare Content-Type 混淆致任意文件读取到远程代码执行漏洞","description":"n8n 工作流自动化平台 1.65.0 至 1.121.0 之前版本中存在 Content-Type 混淆漏洞（Ni8mare），攻击者可通过篡改 Webhook 请求的 Content-Type 头为 application/json，绕过 multipart/form-data 校验，利用 Form 节点未验证 Content-Type 的缺陷覆盖 req.body.files 对象，实现任意文件读取。进一步可读取 n8n 数据库文件获取管理员凭证和加密密钥，伪造会话令牌实现认证绕过，最终通过 Execute Command 节点实现远程代码执行。该漏洞无需认证，远程攻击即可利用，CVSS 评分 10.0，影响面极广。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2026-02574130","CVE-2026-21858","GHSA-v4pr-fm98-w9pg"],"sources":["cve","ghsa","hwpoc"],"published":"2026-01-07","updated":"2026-07-21","remediation":"立即将 n8n 升级至 1.121.0 或更高版本，该版本修复了 Webhook 请求处理中对 Content-Type 头的校验逻辑缺陷。自托管用户可通过 npm update -g n8n 或 Docker 拉取最新镜像升级。作为临时缓解措施，建议限制或禁用公开可访问的 Webhook 和 Form 端点，并对所有 Form 启用身份认证要求，避免将 n8n 实例暴露在公网。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/n8n-io/n8n/security/advisories/GHSA-v4pr-fm98-w9pg","https://www.cyera.com/research-labs/ni8mare-unauthenticated-remote-code-execution-in-n8n-cve-2026-21858","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-21858"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0170.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0437","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0437.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-14257","title":"juliangruber brace-expansion 大括号展开无限制长度导致内存耗尽拒绝服务漏洞","description":"brace-expansion 库的 expand() 函数在展开大括号表达式时，仅限制了结果数量（默认 max=100,000）而未限制单个结果的长度。攻击者可通过构造大量嵌套的大括号组（如 '{a,b}'.repeat(1500)），使每个结果字符串随组数线性增长，导致内存消耗呈 max×N 量级膨胀，最终触发 V8 引擎不可捕获的致命内存溢出错误，造成 Node.js 进程崩溃。该漏洞影响所有使用 brace-expansion 直接或间接（通过 minimatch/glob 等）处理用户输入大括号模式的应用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。攻击者仅需发送约 7.5 KB 的恶意输入即可触发拒绝服务，且由于是致命错误而非可捕获异常，try/catch 无法防护。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-14257","GHSA-mh99-v99m-4gvg"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01","updated":"2026-01-01","remediation":"升级 brace-expansion 至 5.0.8 或更高版本，该版本新增 `maxLength` 选项（默认 4,000,000），在输出构建循环中限制单次 `expand()` 调用的总字符数，防止内存耗尽。如无法立即升级，调用 `expand()` 时传入显式的 `max` 和 `maxLength` 选项限制结果数量和总长度，并避免将不可信用户输入传递给 `expand()` 或 glob 大括号模式。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion","https://github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/commit/a1bd33999ea75262c4749fff3bbb0d1372bd07b5","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2026/14xxx/CVE-2026-14257.json","https://github.com/rmyndharis/OpenWA/blob/01867fcd6ed4ad2b012e29f4c06e3fa80fdcc4a6/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/maxritter/pilot-shell/blob/7b261d235eed8882a414e1a706de1d06eff76db3/.trivyignore","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/npm/brace-expansion/CVE-2026-14257.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/59adead62d41f907bd4d8297210669925a301433/2026/14xxx/CVE-2026-14257.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2026-14257.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-14257.md","https://github.com/chromebrew/chromebrew/blob/2c895573a17b1ca79b43599ae31d490867f0829b/manifest/armv7l/t/tabby.filelist","https://github.com/puemos/hls-downloader/blob/2a3afec924ae6bef4012572083b694310641e980/patches/brace-expansion@1.1.16.patch","https://github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/blob/473d3e95e9614c783a6033f9c8577c0ba9cb6881/src/index.ts"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0437.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0435","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0435.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53720","title":"pymonocypher: Potential heap buffer overflow on nb_blocks in argon2i_32 when provided buffer is too small","description":"### Impact\nThe argon2i_32 implementation does not check the nb_blocks size.  If the caller does not provide a sufficiently large buffer based on the API contract, then argon2i_32 will write past the end of the buffer and possibly corrupt the heap.\n\n### Patches\nFixed in 4.0.2.8, which now verifies that nb_blocks is large enough.  See [90ff5b1](https://github.com/jetperch/pymonocypher/commit/90ff5b13b13b5673c372e188f482d8c172e6ab86).\n\n### Workarounds\nProvide a correctly sized nb_blocks buffer.\n\npymonocypher thanks Haris (hextheshadow) for the vulnerability report, details, and recommended fix.\n","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53720","GHSA-8f95-v3jq-cj86"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01","updated":"2026-01-01","remediation":"请参考官方安全公告，及时安装安全更新或升级到最新版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-26T15:34:24.666461049+00:00","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0435.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0434","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0434.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53719","title":"Envoy Gateway: Nil-dereference when SecurityPolicy targets TCPRoute without spec.authorization","description":"Vulnerability report without repro case. Repro case may be added later after harness is complete.\n\n**Preconditions (4):**\n- Tenant has SecurityPolicy + TCPRoute RBAC (baseline)\n- Tenant namespace permitted to attach TCPRoute to a Gateway listener\n- spec.authorization omitted (the trigger)\n- No admission webhook blocks the shape\n\n**Description:**\n\nA namespace-scoped tenant can deterministically panic the gatewayapi runner on every reconcile with a single CRD; the recover() in message/watchutil.go:53 keeps the process alive but unwinds the entire handle() callback in runner/runner.go:192, so xDS/Infra IR publishing stalls controller-wide until an admin deletes the object. Data plane keeps serving last-good config.\n","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53719","GHSA-m2v6-2jmh-4c68"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01","updated":"2026-01-01","remediation":"请参考官方安全公告，及时安装安全更新或升级到最新版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-26T01:03:15.905987126+00:00","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0434.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0433","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0433.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53718","title":"Envoy Gateway custom backendRef cross-namespace ReferenceGrant bypass","description":"### Impact\nEnvoy Gateway accepts extension-managed custom backendRefs from an HTTPRoute to a backend resource in another namespace without requiring a matching Gateway API ReferenceGrant in the target namespace. This breaks the Gateway API cross-namespace consent model: the namespace that owns the referenced backend resource does not need to opt in with a ReferenceGrant before another namespace’s HTTPRoute can use that resource.\n\n### Patches\n[1.7.4](https://github.com/envoyproxy/gateway/releases/tag/v1.7.4)\n[1.8.1](https://github.com/envoyproxy/gateway/releases/tag/v1.8.1)\n","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53718","GHSA-fcrp-7gc2-93g7"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01","updated":"2026-01-01","remediation":"请参考官方安全公告，及时安装安全更新或升级到最新版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-26T00:16:40.040664396+00:00","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0433.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0432","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0432.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53717","title":"Envoy Gateway: OCI layer extraction allocates make([]byte, h.Size) from untrusted tar header","description":"Vulnerability report without repro case. Repro case may be added later after harness is complete.\n\n**Preconditions (4):**\n- Tenant can create EnvoyExtensionPolicy (baseline)\n- Controller has egress to attacker-controlled OCI registry\n- No registry allowlist (none exists in code)\n- Layer presents Docker/OCI media type\n\n**Description**\n\nAt imagefetcher.go:287, make([]byte, h.Size) uses the attacker-controlled tar-header size; the LimitReader at :278 bounds bytes read from the stream but not the header-declared size returned by tr.Next() (a 512-byte header can claim a multi-TB entry via PAX/GNU encoding). Reached from untrusted tenant input via EnvoyExtensionPolicy spec.wasm[].code.image.url (envoyextensionpolicy.go:1157 → cache.go:262/299 → imagefetcher.go:218 → :287), and the allocation happens for every tar entry regardless of filename. The resulting Go runtime OOM throw is unrecoverable and, because the CRD persists, crash-loops the shared controller — single-request, non-volumetric, cluster-wide DoS.\n","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53717","GHSA-h7pq-86h8-rp5x"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01","updated":"2026-01-01","remediation":"请参考官方安全公告，及时安装安全更新或升级到最新版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T23:22:18.757185531+00:00","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0432.toml"}]